-lines.push("- Empirical bar (ratio >= 8 and assistant count >= 30, smoothing 0.5) returns no unigram stems in this corpus: the seeded offenders themselves score roughly 2.9 to 3.4x (honest 3.4, ruling 3.3, ground 2.9, distill has only 38 assistant hits), well under 8, so the threshold selects no word as slop yet. The empirical list stays empty until the voice signal separates further as logs grow.");
